lamp-manager (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * GTK4 interface to manage Apache, MySQL and PHP-FPM services.
  * Virtual host management with a2ensite/a2dissite integration.
  * PHP configuration editor for common php.ini parameters.
  * Service log viewer with color-coded severity levels.
  * Mailpit email testing service integration.
  * Port monitoring and Apache+PHP-FPM warning banner.

